Integration patch for the Vue dashboard/org repo-list pagination adapter (src/dashboard-pagination.mjs
+ src/dashboard-pagination.css). Not applied to shared files per this branch's scope; verified with
`git apply --check` against origin/main 4039a63 ("feat(release): wire organization/pagination/slack
enhancers into shipped skin 0.3.0 (#54)") — this branch is rebased onto that tip, so pagination.mjs,
pagination-model.mjs and organization.mjs are already wired/shipped; this patch adds the dashboard
pager on top of that AND retires organization.mjs's own partial, now-superseded pager decoration
(see the cutover section below — this is a true replacement, not two decorators layered on one
pager). Apply from the repo root, THEN IMMEDIATELY run `npm run build` before running any
tests — `npm test`'s first step (`check:generated`) and `tests/installer_test.py`'s dist-plan
tests both compare against the committed `dist/`, which this patch's changed `scripts/build.mjs`/
`scripts/install.py` make stale until rebuilt; that rebuild is REQUIRED, not optional, before
`npm test` will pass again:
`git apply integrations/dashboard-pagination/skin-integration.patch && npm run build`.

